1
00:00:00,066 --> 00:00:02,566
(Howard:)Then our problem would be solved.

2
00:00:03,235 --> 00:00:05,945
(Leonard:)Hang on, are we talking about
murdering Dennis Kim?

3
00:00:07,239 --> 00:00:09,119
(Leonard:)I'm not saying no.

4
00:00:09,992 --> 00:00:12,452
(Howard:)We don't have to go that far.
There are other means.

5
00:00:12,953 --> 00:00:15,453
(Raj:)We can't send him back to North Korea.

6
00:00:15,623 --> 00:00:16,873
(Raj:)He knows how to get out.

7
00:00:19,335 --> 00:00:22,715
(Howard:)The only thing we need to do
is make this Kim kid lose his focus.

8
00:00:22,880 --> 00:00:25,760
It won't happen. He is not interested
in anything but physics.

9
00:00:25,925 --> 00:00:27,635
- What about biology?
- What?

10
00:00:27,802 --> 00:00:30,802
(Howard:)You know, biology.

11
00:00:30,971 --> 00:00:33,891
(Howard:)The one thing that can completely derail
a world-class mind.

12
00:00:34,058 --> 00:00:36,098
- Howard, he's 15.
- Yeah, so?

13
00:00:36,268 --> 00:00:38,058
When I was 15, I met Denise Palmeri...

14
00:00:38,229 --> 00:00:42,319
(Howard:)...and my grade point average
fell from a 5.0 to a 1.8.

15
00:00:42,483 --> 00:00:43,773
(Raj:)She was sleeping with you?

16
00:00:44,235 --> 00:00:48,865
(Howard:)No, I just wasted a lot of time thinking
about what it would be like if she did.

17
00:00:50,157 --> 00:00:51,617
(Sheldon(entering):)Oh, good, you're all here.

18
00:00:51,784 --> 00:00:56,084
(Sheldon(entering):)I've decided that if the three of you drop
whatever you're working on and join me...

19
00:00:56,247 --> 00:01:02,027
(Sheldon(entering):)...we could lick cold fusion
in less than a decade, 12 years tops.

